# Pairs with BulkHintBound. The old leaf's replay advances its read position past
# a foreign record of its range without applying it, so the capped hint lies
# above a record no leaf holds.
MODULE: BulkHintBoundReplayOSkipsRecord
TARGET: BulkHintBound
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the old leaf's replay advances past a foreign record without applying it
PERTURBS: ReplayO

--- FIND
    /\ rowsO' = IF author[rpO + 1] \in {"f", "s"} /\ ~narrowed THEN rowsO \cup {rpO + 1} ELSE rowsO
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the record is not applied.
    /\ rowsO' = rowsO
--- END